lacement=1`, uniform random bytes, lengths 0..256 | [ ] |\n| 34 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0`, biased random (valid chars ⊕ invalid bytes), lengths 0..1024 | [ ] |\n| 35 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=1`, biased random (valid chars ⊕ invalid bytes), lengths 0..1024 | [ ] |\n| 36 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=1`, exactly `n` invalid bytes for `n` ∈ {1,2,3,1364,1365,1366,1367,2730,2731,2732,4095,4096,4097} → `repl < 3` / `REPLACEMENT_INC` boundary | [ ] |\n| 37 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0`, same `n` sweep as row 36 (no realloc at all) | [ ] |\n| 38 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=1`, ≥ 10000 invalid bytes interleaved with valid multi-byte chars (multiple realloc rounds) | [ ] |\n| 39 | `w_utf8_filter` | non-normalized `replacement` ∈ {2, 3, 0x7F, 0xFF} with invalid input | [ ] |\n| 40 | `w_utf8_filter` | non-normalized `replacement` ∈ {0x100, 0xFF00, 0xFFFFFF00} (low byte 0 ⇒ false) with invalid input | [ ] |\n| 41 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0/1`, bytes present after the NUL terminator | [ ] |\n| 42 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0/1`, long input ≥ 8192 bytes, all valid (`strdup`) | [ ] |\n| 43 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0/1`, long input ≥ 8192 bytes with scattered invalid bytes | [ ] |\n| 44 | `w_utf8_drop` + `w_utf8_filter` | composed pipeline: `filter` output fed back into `drop` (must always report the NUL), for random inputs, both `replacement` values | [ ] |\n| 45 | `w_utf8_filter` | idempotence check: `filter(filter(s))` compared C-vs-Rust, both `replacement` values | [ ] |\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4641,"cache_read_input_tokens":44706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4641,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07e979d6-63d7-48dc-ac71-77490c70e46a","uuid":"cf67c9ad-06a1-4bdb-9a30-3c9b23339fc0","timestamp":"2026-08-20T17