ytes), lengths 0..1024 | [ ] |","-| 36 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=1`, exactly `n` invalid bytes for `n` ∈ {1,2,3,1364,1365,1366,1367,2730,2731,2732,4095,4096,4097} → `repl < 3` / `REPLACEMENT_INC` boundary | [ ] |","-| 37 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0`, same `n` sweep as row 36 (no realloc at all) | [ ] |","-| 38 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=1`, ≥ 10000 invalid bytes interleaved with valid multi-byte chars (multiple realloc rounds) | [ ] |","-| 39 | `w_utf8_filter` | non-normalized `replacement` ∈ {2, 3, 0x7F, 0xFF} with invalid input | [ ] |","-| 40 | `w_utf8_filter` | non-normalized `replacement` ∈ {0x100, 0xFF00, 0xFFFFFF00} (low byte 0 ⇒ false) with invalid input | [ ] |","-| 41 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0/1`, bytes present after the NUL terminator | [ ] |","-| 42 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0/1`, long input ≥ 8192 bytes, all valid (`strdup`) | [ ] |","-| 43 | `w_utf8_filter` | `replacement=0/1`, long input ≥ 8192 bytes with scattered invalid bytes | [ ] |","-| 44 | `w_utf8_drop` + `w_utf8_filter` | composed pipeline: `filter` output fed back into `drop` (must always report the NUL), for random inputs, both `replacement` values | [ ] |","-| 45 | `w_utf8_filter` | idempotence check: `filter(filter(s))` compared C-vs-Rust, both `replacement` values | [ ] |","+| #  | entry point(s) | configuration (options set + input shape) | test | [x] |","+|----|----------------|-------------------------------------------|------|-----|","+| 1  | `w_utf8_drop` | `\"\"` (empty) | `row01_drop_empty` | [x] |","+| 2  | `w_utf8_drop` | pure ASCII `0x01..0x7F`: exhaustive single bytes + 4000 random strings, len 0..64 | `row02_drop_ascii` | [x] |","+| 3  | `w_utf8_drop` | exhaustive **all 256** single-byte strings | `row03_drop_all_1byte` | [x] |","+| 4  | `w_utf8_drop` | exhaustive **all 65 536** two-byte strings | `row04_drop_all_2byte` | [x] |","+| 5  | `w_utf8_drop` | exhaustive 3-byte strings, leads `0xE0..0xEF` × all 256 × all 256 (1 048 576) | `row05_dr